OL,3,GNEWSAStaff must be paid after sudden
OL,4,Aschool closure, MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a 135-year-old private school
OL,7,Fwhich closed suddenly during half term
OL,8,Fmust be paid "what they're owed without
OL,9,Fdelay", an MP has said.
OL,11,FConcept Education announced on its
OL,12,Fwebsite on Tuesday that Leweston
OL,13,FSchool, near Sherborne in Dorset, would
OL,14,F"not reopen after half term and will
OL,15,Fclose".
OL,17,FThe BBC understands Concept Education,
OL,18,Fwhose subsidiary bought the school in
OL,19,FDecember 2025, said wages owed in
OL,20,FOctober would not be paid.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
